    <String Id="InstallScopeDlg_Title">Nokia NEDR Agent Setup</String>
    <String Id="InstallScopeDlgPerUserDescription">Nokia NEDR Agent will be installed in a per-user folder and be available just for your user account. You do not need local Administrator privileges.</String>
    <String Id="InstallScopeDlgNoPerUserDescription">Nokia NEDR Agent does not support per-user installation.</String>
    <String Id="InstallScopeDlgPerMachineDescription">Nokia NEDR Agent will be installed in a per-machine folder by default and be available for all users. You can change the default installation folder. You must have local Administrator privileges.</String>
