    <String Id="MaintenanceWelcomeDlg_Title">Nokia NEDR Agent Setup</String>
    <String Id="MaintenanceWelcomeDlgDescription">The Setup Wizard allows you to change the way Nokia NEDR Agent features are installed on your computer or to remove it from your computer. Click Next to continue or Cancel to exit the Setup Wizard.</String>
