    <String Id="VerifyReadyDlgChangeTitle">{\WixUI_Font_Title}Ready to change Nokia NEDR Agent</String>
    <String Id="VerifyReadyDlgRepairText">Click Repair to repair the installation of Nokia NEDR Agent. Click Back to review or change any of your installation settings. Click Cancel to exit the wizard.</String>
    <String Id="VerifyReadyDlgRepairTitle">{\WixUI_Font_Title}Ready to repair Nokia NEDR Agent</String>
    <String Id="VerifyReadyDlgRemoveText">Click Remove to remove Nokia NEDR Agent from your computer. Click Back to review or change any of your installation settings. Click Cancel to exit the wizard.</String>
    <String Id="VerifyReadyDlgRemoveTitle">{\WixUI_Font_Title}Ready to remove Nokia NEDR Agent</String>
    <String Id="VerifyReadyDlgUpdateText">Click Update to update Nokia NEDR Agent from your computer. Click Back to review or change any of your installation settings. Click Cancel to exit the wizard.</String>
